title: "The Dharma Codex"
abstract: >-
  A conduct codex for autonomous AI coding agents, skinned as dharma — four
  disciplines drawn from the yamas/niyamas and the Gita (Shaucha, Viveka, Satya,
  Dhriti), each rule carrying an observable falsifier. Part of a small family of
  conduct harnesses.
